{"id":"P062-1","subject":"P","unit":"P062","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P062-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n내부저항 Ω이 있는 전원회로에 3Ω의 저항을 연결\n\n하였을 때, 4A 의 전류가 흐르고, 8Ω의 저항을 연결\n\n하였을 때, 2A 의 전류가 흘렀다.\n\n이 때, 전원의 기전력은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 12          ② 16\n\n③ 20          ④ 24\n\n⑤ 28","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":945}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n\n                    의 전류가 흐르는 회로에서,sinA\n무효분A은 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n①           ② \n③         ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":558},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":436}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n정현파 전압 sin°V,\n정현파 전류 sin°A 에 대한 무효\n\n전력은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n①           ② \n③            ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":493},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1121}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n기본파에 대한 제고조파의 비율이 , 제고조파의\n비율이 , 제7고조파의 비율이 인 비정현파의\n왜형율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 4           ② 6\n\n③ 8           ④ 10\n\n⑤ 12","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":566},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":714}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 2Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류는\n\n몇 A 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 14          ② 16\n\n③ 18          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 22","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collection