식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n평행판 콘덴서의 유전율이 × Fm이고, 고유저항\n이 k Ω, 정전용량이 F일 때, 저항은 몇 k Ω\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 1\n\n③ 5           ④ 10\n\n⑤ 50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":651},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":451}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n무한직선 도선으로부터 1m 떨어진 곳의 자계의 세기가\n\n2ATm일 때, 도선에 흐르는 전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n①           ② \n\n                        \n③            ④ \n\n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":626},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1302}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n비투자율이 501인 환상철심에 외부자계 2000ATm를\n가하여 자화시킬 때, 자화의 세기는 몇 m인가?\n\n\n\n\n①           ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":606},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":580}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n전속밀도 가 경계면에 의 각도로 입사하여 의 각도\n로 굴절한다. °, 가 공기중의 유전율과 같고,\n의 비유전율이 일 때, 은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0°          ② 30°\n\n③ 45°          ④ 60°\n\n⑤ 90°","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":810},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1454}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n절연물의 종별 분류에서 B종과 H종 사이에 있는 종의\n\n최대허용온도는 몇 °C인가?\n\n\n① 90          ② 105\n\n③ 120         ④ 155\n\n⑤ 180","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":428}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n파권 직류 발전기의 총 도체수가 600, 극당 자속수가\n\n0.02이고, 회전속도가 600rpm일 때의 기전력이\n\n240V이다. 이 발전기의 극수는 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8\n\n⑤ 10","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":550},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n\n단절권 계수가                       때, 코일피치와 자극피치비        sin일\n\n는?\n\n\n                          \n①            ② \n\n                        \n③           ④ \n\n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":728},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n내부 임피던스강하가 큰 화력발전소의 동기발전기에 관한\n\n설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 단락전류가 작다.   ② 계자의 반경이 작다.\n\n③ 전압의 변동이 크다.  ④ 과도 안정도가 크다.\n\n⑤ 회전자의 축이 길다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m23-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n동기기의 전기자 반작용에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 기전력보다 앞선전류인 경우, 증자작용이다.\n\n② 기전력보다 뒤진전류인 경우, 직축반작용이다.\n\n③ 기전력과 동상전류인 경우, 횡축반작용이다.\n\n④ 전기자 반작용과 유기기전력의 변화는 관계가 없다.\n\n⑤ 역률이 1인 경우, 교차자화작용이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":552},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1127}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P062-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n단상 변압기의 1차측 기전력이 3300V, 2차측 기전력이\nV, 1차측 저항이 Ω, 2차측으로 환산한\n저항이 Ω일 때, 변압기의 권수비 는?\n\n\n① 60          ② 40\n\n③ 30          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 15","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.02 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e21-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":612},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e21-m25-e1.webp","width":678,"height":755}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]}]}
